              "bucket": "yerek"
            },
            {
              "text": "söyle-",
              "bucket": "yerek"
            }
          ],
          "explanation": "Two questions. Last vowel back (a ı o u) — -arak, front (e i ö ü) — -erek. Stem ends in a vowel — y goes first."
        }
      ]
